      "writtenOn": "2023-06-22T14:45:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, apologies - roughly what that bug finds is that there\u0027s other issues occurring in PermissionControllerManager:\n\n1) aosp/2629749, within PCM we\u0027re not honoring the hardware boot multiplier, so we\u0027re often not giving enough time for default grants to be applied.\n2) aosp/2629381, occasionally when it takes too long, the system should at least recover by restarting zygote, but it currently doesn\u0027t - this CL fixes an issue where we block the main thread and never run the timeout handler.",
